---
title: "state::new (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_uid: uid = object::new(ctx)
    q_uid --> q_ds_reg: data_source::new_data_source_registry(uid, ctx)
    q_ds_reg --> q_pi_reg: price_info::new_price_info_registry(uid, ctx)
    q_pi_reg --> q_loop: !vector::is_empty(sources)
    q_loop --> q_add: true, data_source::add(uid, pop_back(sources))
    q_loop --> q_vaas: false
    q_add --> q_loop
    q_vaas --> q_consumed: consumed_vaas = consumed_vaas::new(ctx)
    q_consumed --> q_pkg: package_utils::init_package_info(uid, current_version, upgrade_cap)
    q_pkg --> [*]: return State { uid, upgrade_cap, governance_data_source, ... }

    note right of q_ds_reg
        INV-001: data source registry is a dynamic field on UID
        INV-002: price info registry is a dynamic object field on UID
        INV-003: fee_recipient_address defaults to tx_context::sender
        INV-004: last_executed_governance_sequence starts at 0
    end note
